# Gandalf, Goblins' Bane: Flameshape's "you may play them if you control a Wizard" is asked each time a card would be played
# (CR 601.3, 305.1). Flameshape exiles an Island and a Lightning Bolt face down. On turn 3, with no Wizard, the Island is not
# offered as Bot1's land play (it plays a Forest from its hand instead); once Sylvan Safekeeper, a Human Wizard, is on the
# battlefield, the exiled Bolt is cast at Bot2. Bot2 Bolts the Safekeeper on turn 4, and on turn 5 the exiled Island is
# refused again while Bot1 still has its land play - it plays an Island from its hand. The Island stays in exile, as does
# Gandalf, on its Adventure (CR 715.4).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Mox Ruby
Gandalf, Goblins' Bane
Forest
Sylvan Safekeeper
Island
Plains
Island
Lightning Bolt
Plains x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Lightning Bolt
Island x15

